title AISOC — End-to-End Workflow

Sources [icon: server, color: red] {
  SIEM     [icon: alert-triangle, label: "Wazuh / SIEM"]
  ANALYST  [icon: user,           label: "Analyst"]
}

Ingest [icon: shield, color: orange] {
  API   [icon: webhook, label: "POST /api/ingest"]
  AUTH  [icon: key,     label: "API key"]
  FILT  [icon: filter,  label: "Severity · Rate · Dedup · Hours"]
}

FP Pipeline (9 layers) [icon: layers, color: pink] {
  L1 [icon: filter,        label: "1-3: Severity · Time · Suppression"]
  L2 [icon: history,       label: "4: Memory match"]
  L3 [icon: server,        label: "5: Asset fast-FP"]
  L4 [icon: brain,         label: "6: Triage LLM"]
  L5 [icon: calculator,    label: "7: Confidence aggregator"]
  L6 [icon: gauge,         label: "8-9: Risk · Priority gate"]
}

Multi-Agent (LangGraph) [icon: cpu, color: blue] {
  PLAN   [icon: brain-circuit, label: "Planner"]
  INTEL  [icon: radar,         label: "Threat Intel"]
  KNOW   [icon: book-open,     label: "Knowledge / RAG"]
  CORR   [icon: network,       label: "Correlation"]
  TICKET [icon: file-text,     label: "Ticketing"]
  RESP   [icon: shield-check,  label: "Response"]
  VALID  [icon: badge-check,   label: "Validation"]
}

Memory [icon: database, color: purple] {
  M_INSIGHT [icon: file-search, label: "Incident insights"]
  M_IOC     [icon: hash,        label: "IOC memory"]
  M_ASSET   [icon: server,      label: "Asset context"]
  M_SUPP    [icon: filter,      label: "Suppression rules"]
  M_WORK    [icon: list-tree,   label: "Working memory"]
}

Storage [icon: database, color: yellow] {
  DB    [icon: database,  label: "SQLite (WAL)"]
  EMBED [icon: sparkles,  label: "Ollama embeddings"]
}

Outcomes [icon: flag, color: green] {
  FP  [icon: x-circle,     label: "FP Archive"]
  INC [icon: alert-octagon, label: "Incident"]
}

Notify [icon: bell, color: teal] {
  TG    [icon: send,       label: "Telegram"]
  SLACK [icon: message-square, label: "Slack"]
  MAIL  [icon: mail,       label: "Email"]
  GLPI  [icon: ticket,     label: "GLPI"]
}

Frontend [icon: monitor, color: gray] {
  UI [icon: layout, label: "Dashboard · Incidents\nKnowledge · Reports · Admin"]
}

SIEM > API
API > AUTH
AUTH > FILT
FILT > L1
L1 > L2
L2 > L3
L3 > L4
L4 > L5
L5 > L6
L6 > FP: low priority
L6 > PLAN: real threat

PLAN > INTEL
PLAN > KNOW
PLAN > CORR
INTEL > TICKET
KNOW > TICKET
CORR > TICKET
TICKET > RESP
RESP > VALID
VALID > INC

L1 > M_SUPP
L2 > M_INSIGHT
L3 > M_ASSET
PLAN > M_WORK
INC > M_IOC
INC > M_INSIGHT

M_INSIGHT > EMBED
EMBED > DB
M_IOC > DB
M_ASSET > DB
M_SUPP > DB
M_WORK > DB

INC > TG
INC > SLACK
INC > MAIL
INC > GLPI

DB > UI
FP > UI
INC > UI
ANALYST > UI
UI > ANALYST: confirm · override · escalate
